    narr:narration """This position holds the settled cadence for recurring reaction summaries: [the per-run bundle stays and a weekly roll-up is added on Fridays](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_2), restated verbatim two days later as [team policy](narr:Expr_20260927_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hf65a0248bea8_2). The scope line runs through [Tanya's clarification that the bundle is for the run and the roll-up is for the week](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_4), echoed in the later record ([same ruling](narr:Expr_20260927_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hf65a0248bea8_4)). A rejected alternative is on the graph: [the daily digest was turned down because it would repeat the bundle word for word](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_5), with the rejection rationale recorded again in the later pass ([rejection re-recorded](narr:Expr_20260927_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hf65a0248bea8_5)). Tina's scope question was relayed both times ([asked whether the roll-up replaces the bundle](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_3); [the same question relayed again](narr:Expr_20260927_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hf65a0248bea8_3)). A third dated pass restates the whole record unchanged — [the ruling quoted a third time](narr:Expr_20260929_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h94add5a10097_2), [the scope line repeated](narr:Expr_20260929_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h94add5a10097_4), [the rejection recorded again](narr:Expr_20260929_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h94add5a10097_5), and [the scope question relayed once more](narr:Expr_20260929_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h94add5a10097_3). A fourth dated pass now repeats the record a final time — [the ruling quoted again](narr:Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_2), [the clarification restated](narr:Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_4), [the rejection carried forward](narr:Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_5), and [the scope question relayed yet again](narr:Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_3). A fifth dated pass repeats the record once more — [the ruling quoted again](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_3), [the scope line carried forward](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_5), [the rejection recorded again](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_6), and [the scope question relayed again](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_4). A sixth dated pass repeats the record unchanged — [the ruling quoted again](narr:Expr_20261005_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h21bf84ec8b35_3), [the scope line carried forward](narr:Expr_20261005_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h21bf84ec8b35_5), [the rejection recorded again](narr:Expr_20261005_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h21bf84ec8b35_6), and [the scope question relayed once more](narr:Expr_20261005_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h21bf84ec8b35_4). The phrasing carries the hub's style-lane signature — antithesis and parallelism in the org lane.""" ;
    narr:reaction """One thing moved: a sixth dated pass arrived, so the record now runs through [the ruling quoted again](narr:Expr_20261005_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h21bf84ec8b35_3), [the scope line carried forward](narr:Expr_20261005_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h21bf84ec8b35_5), [the rejection recorded again](narr:Expr_20261005_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h21bf84ec8b35_6), and [the scope question relayed once more](narr:Expr_20261005_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h21bf84ec8b35_4). Everything else held byte for byte — the cadence ruling, the scope line, the daily-digest rejection, and [Tina's](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_3) relayed question are unchanged, and the pattern is now six identical restatements with no new tension.""" ;
